{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1045900,\"title\":\"DAD IS HERE\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"This movie tells the story of an \\\"unreliable\\\" father and \\\"super reliable\\\" daughter swapping bodies due to a magical lottery ticket. The gangster father becomes the daughter who returns back to his youth and cause chaos in school. While the smart daughter becomes the father, who starts tidying up the hunting and his jianghu. They become closer to each other through this awkward and hilarious misplaced life. As the \\\"proud daughter\\\" and \\\"failed father\\\" make peace, they let each other go, but also reflect on themselves.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8jegYNcAQWYs6oIoG2dmXEnWfip.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zmIKGjI4HQ9nYZmupMAQlDCDWB5.jpg\",\"rating\":3,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2022,\"runtime\":89,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"刘海亮\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3786744,\"name\":\"刘海亮\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":237822,\"name\":\"Zhou Xiaoou\",\"character\":\"Qin Yun Fei\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nAOEt5t1L5fECCs6FZsBGDOARcS.jpg\"},{\"id\":3786751,\"name\":\"SATO\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2140106,\"name\":\"Huang Cailun\",\"character\":\"Zhao Wen Ming\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/blvudwE8C0fOYde94LgYfEaYqiY.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":116745,\"title\":\"The Secret Life of Walter Mitty\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iAo1hlzsPV9XpYcLQp6Ud065tGO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8hSjOHRY4OUEpqxszYbMdem8z9C.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A timid magazine photo manager who lives life vicariously through daydreams embarks on a true-life adventure when a negative goes missing.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":508943,\"title\":\"Luca\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9x4i9uKGXt8IiiIF5Ey0DIoY738.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/620hnMVLu6RSZW6a5rwO8gqpt0t.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Luca and his best friend Alberto experience an unforgettable summer on the Italian Riviera. But all the fun is threatened by a deeply-held secret: they are sea monsters from another world just below the water’s surface.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9339,\"title\":\"Click\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oL0k5JA53PyoHSZqKb3cNkhwBCE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n6eIm882V7cj0In0xp8QXNItoTp.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A married workaholic, Michael Newman doesn't have time for his wife and children, not if he's to impress his ungrateful boss and earn a well-deserved promotion. So when he meets Morty, a loopy sales clerk, he gets the answer to his prayers: a magical remote that allows him to bypass life's little distractions with increasingly hysterical results.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12797,\"title\":\"Ghost Town\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b8VS14DwpLlugTxVWSllYU0Gjn5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iDgK5UFgXKVqegWYc5tl58qfGOw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bertram Pincus, a cranky, people-hating Manhattan dentist, develops the unwelcome ability to see dead people. Really annoying dead people. Even worse, they all want something from him, particularly Frank Herlihy, a smooth-talking ghost, who pesters him into a romantic scheme involving his widow Gwen. They are soon entangled in a hilarious predicament between the now and the hereafter!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5994,\"title\":\"The Family Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9wToOVsKuf0XeKhlauzCa3D8Gui.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gnosJeDIDQXy9uDewXphEpDWNYT.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jack's lavish, fast-paced lifestyle changes one Christmas night when he stumbles into a grocery store holdup and disarms the gunman. The next morning he wakes up in bed lying next to Kate, his college sweetheart he left in order to pursue his career, and to the horrifying discovery that his former life no longer exists. As he stumbles through this alternate suburban universe, Jack finds himself at a crossroad where he must choose between his high-power career and the woman he loves.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":616747,\"title\":\"Haunted Mansion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Im6DknDVxRiGXc5t8rVOJyzuNx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Als2QyqbLgT5G3rwTGJta8QQfqP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A woman and her son enlist a motley crew of so-called spiritual experts to help rid their home of supernatural squatters.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11653,\"title\":\"The Myth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iBDFnLkTZZxQlbb6IIeYkufnPCY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xChyWmjDeEH8zOVi9dwVrtIJEfd.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a fellow scientist asks for Jack's help in locating the mausoleum of China's first emperor, the past collides violently with the present as Jack discovers his amazing visions are based in fact.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40096,\"title\":\"A Dog's Will\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z9Au9XtK0ARzkKGsZCzMkmKgMPf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/alQqTpmEkxSLgajfEYTsTH6nAKB.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The lively João Grilo and the sly Chicó are poor guys living in the hinterland who cheat a bunch of people in a small town in Northeastern Brazil. When they die, they have to be judged by Christ, the Devil and the Virgin Mary before they are admitted to paradise.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13688,\"title\":\"CJ7\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sRzSfpSb3wYYshbaiMRIuFCJJGU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7y0ol1zsvs0GbYR0BdTvWdOIDHo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A poor construction worker, who struggles to keep his son in private school, mistakes an orb he finds in a junkjard for a toy which proves to be much, much more once the young boy starts to play with it.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":238215,\"title\":\"The Cobbler\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oMgBX4uqF1VIz95tD4iJggz6Ceh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ysSUDoBeG5oIz7e4vkTtsuGBXfe.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Max Simkin repairs shoes in the same New York shop that has been in his family for generations. Disenchanted with the grind of daily life, Max stumbles upon a magical heirloom that allows him to step into the lives of his customers and see the world in a new way. Sometimes walking in another man's shoes is the only way one can discover who they really are.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":923939,\"title\":\"The Wonderful Story of Henry Sugar\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fDUywEHwHh6nsLnVXAdPN9m4ZUG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dS4JR8gmj8UnamjuLEyAkEFoppy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A rich man learns about a guru who can see without using his eyes. He sets out to master the 